---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | CivicConnect" description="Read the terms governing your use of CivicConnect.">
  <div class="py-24 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-caption-mono text-mute tracking-[0.15em] block mb-3">agreement</span>
      <h1 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Last Updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Welcome to CivicConnect. By using this website, you agree to comply with the following Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        These terms govern your access to the CivicConnect assistant, directories, and static pages. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of the platform.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">2. Use License</h2>
      <p>
        You are granted a limited license to query the platform and read summary details for personal, educational, or non-commercial information purposes. You may not scrape, frame, or automate queries to load-test or block the system's endpoints.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The summaries, code files, and user interface designs are property of CivicConnect. All legal acts, constitutional clauses, and government scheme eligibility rules remain the property of the respective government authorities.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">4. Prohibited Behaviors</h2>
      <p>
        You may not use the assistant to input offensive words, submit malicious scripts via forms, or try to reverse-engineer the prompt structures.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-body-md text-ink font-semibold mt-8">5. Disclaimers of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        CIVICCONNECT IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. WE DISCLAIM ANY LIABILITY FOR ERRORS, OMISSIONS, OR ACTIONS TAKEN BY USERS BASED ON AI-GENERATED ANSWERS. USERS MUST ALWAYS CROSS-CHECK Entitlements OR LEGAL DEADLINES WITH CERTIFIED PUBLIC OFFICIALS.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
